9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,500
People look to your face for the context

10
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:30,960
behind what you're saying.

11
00:00:31,719 --> 00:00:33,799
People look to your face for the context

12
00:00:33,799 --> 00:00:35,039
behind what you're saying.

13
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,200
I mean, imagine this.

14
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,799
Imagine you go to someone's funeral and you say,

15
00:00:38,759 --> 00:00:40,820
I'm so sorry for your loss.

16
00:00:42,079 --> 00:00:44,179
They're going to think you murdered the person.

17
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,420
