43
00:01:47,140 --> 00:01:49,000
You'll be able to know a little more

44
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,700
about what's going on with that person

45
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,120
and what's going on in their world.

46
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,680
Believe it or not, if you get better

