And please do this.

168
00:06:25,980 --> 00:06:27,199
Make sure you do this.

169
00:06:27,579 --> 00:06:29,199
Just do it while I'm doing it

170
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:31,379
so you can feel how it feels on your face.

171
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,500
So make sure you do it.

